OL,3,GNEWSAPolice at sheltered housing
OL,4,Abuilding after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers remain at the scene of
OL,7,Fa blaze which broke out overnight in
OL,8,FWorthing.
OL,10,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue said it
OL,11,Fsent four crews to tackle the fire at
OL,12,FSompting Road, Broadwater, shortly
OL,13,Fafter 04:00 BST.
OL,15,FPolice vehicles were seen outside
OL,16,FGlawood House, a small sheltered
OL,17,Fhousing complex of studio flats later.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
