OL,3,GNEWSAPolice at sheltered housing
OL,4,Abuilding after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Sussex Police said
OL,7,F"inquiries remain ongoing to establish
OL,8,Fthe full circumstances" and a partial
OL,9,Fclosure of Sompting Road remains in
OL,10,Fplace.
